vars: { d2-config: { sketch: true; theme-id: 0; pad: 30 } }
direction: right

born: "Constructor runs\n\nStudent A(...);" {style.fill: "#E3F0FB"; style.font-size: 18}
lives: "Object lives\nuse methods\n\nA.study();\n→ Prathmesh is Studying" {style.fill: "#FFF3C4"; style.font-size: 18}
dies: "Destructor runs\n\n~Student()" {style.fill: "#FDEDEC"; style.font-size: 18}
born -> lives -> dies

note: |md
  Destructor runs **automatically**: at the closing `}` for a normal object, or on `delete ptr;` for a `new` object

  Name = `~ClassName()`, no arguments, no return type, only one per class
| {near: bottom-center}
